OL,3,AKilmar Abrego Garcia leaving US for
OL,4,ASpain, ending Trump deportation battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FKilmar Abrego Garcia, whose deportation
OL,7,Flast year to El Salvador sparked a
OL,8,Fbitter deportation battle, is leaving
OL,9,Fthe US for Spain.
OL,11,FHe is set to take a commercial flight
OL,12,Fto the country on Tuesday, according to
OL,13,FCBS News, the BBC's US partner.
OL,15,FAfter the government admitted it had
OL,16,Fwrongfully sent Abrego Garcia to his
OL,17,Fhome country, he was returned to the US
OL,18,Fto face human trafficking charges,
OL,19,Fwhich were later dropped. The
OL,20,Fadministration then continued its
OL,21,Fattempts to send him to other
OL,22,Fcountries, including Uganda and Ghana.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
